{
"Items.LightMaidenArmor.Desc": "A skimpy chain bikini that barely qualifies as armor. The chain is made from links much finer and lighter than normal, and it feels almost like silk under your fingertips. A simple seal in the g-string-like undergarment states, \"Virgins only\". It looks like it wouldn't fit anyone with a cup size under DD or without a female frame."
"Items.LightMaidenArmor.Long": "a bikini-like set of armor that could only belong to a lusty maiden"
"Items.LightMaidenArmor.Short": "L.MaidenArmor"
}
